# 统一换行符：仓库内统一为 LF，检出到 Windows 工作区时按需转换
* text=auto

# Windows 脚本明确使用 CRLF，避免手工编辑 / 双击运行时出现异常
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件，禁止换行符与编码转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary

# 单据/数据文件保持原样，GitHub 也能按语言高亮统计
*.jsonl text
*.csv text
